{"ticker":{"symbol":"310200.KQ","name":"애니플러스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2000.0,"change_pct":-0.024390243902439046,"market_cap":104317009920.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.03475,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":3715.0,"sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Broadcasting","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":54,"website":"https://www.aniplustv.com","business_summary":"ANIPLUS INC., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the content distribution and merchandise businesses. It offers ANIPLUS ASIA, an animation channel; K-PLUS, a K-drama channel. The company is also involved in the provision of various media art exhibitions; selling various animation-related products through website; and event and film, as well as broadcasting, OTT, dramas, merchandise, and production businesses. The company was incorporated in 2015 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea. Aniplus Inc. operates as a subsidiary of JJ Mediaworks.","business_summary_ko":"애니플러스(주)는 자회사와 함께 콘텐츠 유통 및 상품 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 애니메이션 채널인 ANIPLUS ASIA를 제공합니다. K드라마 채널 K-PLUS입니다. 이 회사는 또한 다양한 미디어 아트 전시회 제공에도 참여하고 있습니다. 웹사이트를 통해 다양한 애니메이션 관련 상품을 판매합니다. 이벤트, 영화, 방송, OTT, 드라마, 상품, 제작 사업 등을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 2015년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 서울에 있습니다. 애니플러스(주)는 JJ미디어웍스의 자회사로 운영됩니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"방송","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":57816068960.0,"operating_income":9919085070.0,"net_income":4018689030.0,"eps":121.125474},{"period":"2023","revenue":111346904320.0,"operating_income":22916306320.0,"net_income":8905944650.0,"eps":202.537678},{"period":"2024","revenue":130975963470.0,"operating_income":25179081030.0,"net_income":15629786940.0,"eps":349.476778},{"period":"2025","revenue":150299705150.0,"operating_income":22692659880.0,"net_income":12071466260.0,"eps":250.0}],"price_history"